1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:47,330 --> 00:01:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Milady, the skies have begun
to look threatening.</font>

32
00:01:51,290 --> 00:01:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should seek lodging for the night
before we get rained on.</font>

33
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. Carry on.</font>

34
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, milady.</font>

35
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What dense fog!</font>

36
00:02:08,230 --> 00:02:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We cannot see what's up ahead.</font>

37
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:15,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?</font>

38
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is something the matter?</font>

39
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:21,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Kayo!</font>

40
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:43,780
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Mystery</font>

41
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:43,840
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the</font>

42
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:44,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Cursed</font>

43
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:44,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ghost</font>

44
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Castle</font>

45
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Of</font>

46
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear that it happened while the mistress
of the Land of Honey, Lady Kayo,</font>

47
00:02:49,890 --> 00:02:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was on her way to visit the household
of her parents in Land of Candy.</font>

48
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Attendants from The Land of Candy
went out to meet them,</font>

49
00:02:56,730 --> 00:02:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">thinking it odd
that their arrival was delayed,</font>

50
00:02:58,990 --> 00:03:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only to find that the palanquin and poles
had been cast away at the mountain pass.</font>

51
00:03:02,780 --> 00:03:06,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am told that Lady Kayo and all
of her attendants have disappeared.</font>

52
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, our task is to search
for the lady, right?</font>

53
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is so.</font>

54
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata's Byakugan
and Kiba and Akamaru's keen sense of smell</font>

55
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should prove helpful
in this search mission,</font>

56
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Naruto is, well, just Naruto.</font>

57
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying, Grandma?</font>

58
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:24,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I have nothing in particular
to recommend me?</font>

59
00:03:24,890 --> 00:03:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But isn't that the case?</font>

60
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:31,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think that you have good points, too,
Naruto.</font>

61
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Leave it to Hinata.</font>

62
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go ahead and list them all
for Grandma Tsunade!</font>

63
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, what are my good points?</font>

64
00:03:42,530 --> 00:03:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... Let me see...</font>

65
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It shouldn't be that hard!</font>

66
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't mean to make it seem that way.
Um... Well...</font>

67
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you two. Are you finished?</font>

68
00:03:58,050 --> 00:04:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Grandma,
there wouldn't be anything odd</font>

69
00:04:00,130 --> 00:04:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">happening in this mission, would there?</font>

70
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something odd?</font>

71
00:04:03,890 --> 00:04:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is to say, might there perhaps...
be ghosts involved?</font>

72
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:11,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ghosts? Are you afraid of such things?</font>

73
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, um... kind of.</font>

74
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no such things as ghosts.</font>

75
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop talking such nonsense
and get on your way.</font>

76
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which brings us to the question
of where to, Fifth Hokage?</font>

77
00:04:23,490 --> 00:04:24,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kubisaki Pass.</font>

78
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kubisaki Pass?
As in the Broken Neck Pass?</font>

79
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew I had a bad premonition.</font>

80
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool!</font>

81
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:35,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shinobi shouldn't dally
about such things. Get going!</font>

82
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're scarier than any ghost!</font>

83
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're off!</font>

84
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse us.</font>

85
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:48,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's always like this with that one.</font>

86
00:04:48,810 --> 00:04:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama,
Kubisaki Pass is where</font>

87
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the capital of the Land of Necks
once stood, isn't it?</font>

88
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ruined castle of the Kubisaki Clan,</font>

89
00:04:57,480 --> 00:05:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which met its destruction 50 years ago,
must still be there.</font>

90
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what of it?</font>

91
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ruined castles may be found
just about anywhere.</font>

92
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you caught
Naruto's cowardice bug, Shizune?</font>

93
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it.</font>

94
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, this is the spot.</font>

95
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Broken Neck Pass.</font>

96
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It gives me the creeps, I tell you.</font>

97
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:38,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's raining now. Let's hurry.</font>

98
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really coming down!</font>

99
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A castle.</font>

100
00:05:49,410 --> 00:05:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hadn't heard anything
about a castle standing here.</font>

101
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:54,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a bad feeling about this.</font>

102
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See, see?! This mission is starting
to get creepier and creepier.</font>

103
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this may be a major clue.</font>

104
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

105
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. At this rate, we'll get soaking wet.</font>

106
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't be in such a hurry!</font>

107
00:06:12,010 --> 00:06:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a magnificent castle.</font>

108
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Won't it be sort of rude
to suddenly intrude upon them?</font>

109
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's almost night.
Maybe we'll be causing them trouble.</font>

110
00:06:19,810 --> 00:06:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, don't tell me
you really are scared!</font>

111
00:06:22,770 --> 00:06:24,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way, I tell you!</font>

112
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pull yourself together, Naruto.</font>

113
00:06:26,990 --> 00:06:28,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

114
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The door opened by itself.</font>

115
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me, is anybody home?</font>

116
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:52,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lights are turned on.</font>

117
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let us shelter here
from the rain for a bit!</font>

118
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait! Akamaru!</font>

119
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse us.</font>

120
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good evening.</font>

121
00:07:07,690 --> 00:07:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something sure smells good.</font>

122
00:07:13,570 --> 00:07:14,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's still warm.</font>

123
00:07:15,030 --> 00:07:16,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was someone here just a little while ago?</font>

124
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

125
00:07:30,010 --> 00:07:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's one scary-looking guy.</font>

126
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he's the master
of this castle.</font>

127
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:38,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he's the master of this castle,
that makes him a feudal lord, right?</font>

128
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this is the feudal lord's castle,</font>

129
00:07:39,810 --> 00:07:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then the area around here
should be the capital.</font>

130
00:07:41,850 --> 00:07:44,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this is right on
the country borderline.</font>

131
00:07:45,150 --> 00:07:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Akamaru!</font>

132
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:48,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?</font>

133
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:51,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't eat that
without permission.</font>

134
00:08:02,370 --> 00:08:04,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto?
— What is it?</font>

135
00:08:04,210 --> 00:08:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't startle me like that.</font>

136
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just now, the painting's eyes moved!</font>

137
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:11,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You moron. How could a painting move?
You're such a scaredy cat.</font>

138
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The table's set for seven people.</font>

139
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what of it?</font>

140
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Honey party
that went missing also numbered seven.</font>

141
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lady and her attendants
may still be in this castle.</font>

142
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's split up and search for them.</font>

143
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...? Split up?</font>

144
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:33,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since we're here together,
why don't we search together?</font>

145
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you say, Kiba? Hinata?</font>

146
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, stop talking like a kid.
This is a mission!</font>

147
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:44,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to scold me so much!
I know that!</font>

148
00:08:47,460 --> 00:08:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait a minute!</font>

149
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm just not cut out
for this kind of stuff.</font>

150
00:08:59,010 --> 00:09:00,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is scarier than going to the bathroom
in the middle of the night.</font>

151
00:09:06,350 --> 00:09:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is creepy!</font>

152
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

153
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:27,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not again!</font>

154
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, Hinata, Akamaru!</font>

155
00:09:30,710 --> 00:09:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm too scared to be alone!</font>

156
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you sense it, too? I'm sure
this is the scent of a human being.</font>

157
00:09:47,230 --> 00:09:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's here.</font>

158
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no one here.</font>

159
00:09:58,490 --> 00:09:59,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll eat you up.</font>

160
00:09:59,950 --> 00:10:01,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that? Is someone there?</font>

161
00:10:03,830 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ceiling...</font>

162
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:08,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that, you.</font>

163
00:10:23,890 --> 00:10:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at all these books.</font>

164
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The History of Neck Castle."</font>

165
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This was written 50 years ago!</font>

166
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The enemy forces have already
surrounded the castle."</font>

167
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our people were brutally slaughtered</font>

168
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and there are only a few of the soldiers
left in the castle.</font>

169
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems certain that I will not live
to see nightfall either.</font>

170
00:10:54,590 --> 00:10:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But my thirst for vengeance
remains in the castle,</font>

171
00:10:57,510 --> 00:11:00,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I vow with this castle
to consume every last man,</font>

172
00:11:01,140 --> 00:11:03,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">every human that sets foot
within these walls...</font>

173
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Signed, Gosa Kubisaki."</font>

174
00:11:06,310 --> 00:11:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Consume?</font>

175
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll eat you.</font>

176
00:11:15,270 --> 00:11:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

177
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosa Kubisaki!</font>

178
00:11:53,650 --> 00:11:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

179
00:12:15,830 --> 00:12:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! Hey!</font>

180
00:12:20,130 --> 00:12:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! Pull yourself together!</font>

181
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

182
00:12:32,390 --> 00:12:34,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Hinata, are you all right?</font>

183
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:36,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, Akamaru!</font>

184
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:43,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A castle that fell 50 years ago?</font>

185
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What nonsense.</font>

186
00:12:45,110 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is how the scroll is dated.</font>

187
00:12:47,990 --> 00:12:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It says that anyone who enters
this castle will be eaten alive.</font>

188
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True, we have been swallowed whole.</font>

189
00:12:57,210 --> 00:12:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto!
— Are you okay? Hey!</font>

190
00:12:59,590 --> 00:13:01,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hurt.</font>

191
00:13:05,090 --> 00:13:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is!</font>

192
00:13:07,430 --> 00:13:09,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I'm sorry.
— What is this?</font>

193
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:14,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the armor of the Kubisaki Clan.</font>

194
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if this belonged
to an enemy soldier.</font>

195
00:13:17,310 --> 00:13:20,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's more over there.
They are different armors.</font>

196
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those armors bear the crest
of the Kubisaki Clan.</font>

197
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry up and get out of here!</font>

198
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the same armor as in the painting.</font>

199
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be...
that this is the real Gosa Kubisaki?</font>

200
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosa Kubisaki?</font>

201
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:51,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

202
00:13:54,810 --> 00:13:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's melting!</font>

203
00:13:57,980 --> 00:13:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

204
00:13:59,810 --> 00:14:01,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something smells really sour.</font>

205
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is something strange
about this castle.</font>

206
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hinata!
— Yeah.</font>

207
00:14:10,410 --> 00:14:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

208
00:14:14,410 --> 00:14:17,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The whole wall is covered
with a flow of Chakra.</font>

209
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

210
00:14:22,750 --> 00:14:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's moving!</font>

211
00:14:24,210 --> 00:14:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This wall seems to be alive!</font>

212
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if...?</font>

213
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:33,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

214
00:14:43,610 --> 00:14:45,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right, Hinata?</font>

215
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-huh.</font>

216
00:14:46,570 --> 00:14:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen something very similar to this
somewhere before.</font>

217
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The giant toad summoned
by the Pervy Sage...</font>

218
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from inside its stomach!</font>

219
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside its stomach?!</font>

220
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I wonder if, by chance,
this smell could be... gastric juices?!</font>

221
00:14:59,710 --> 00:15:02,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosa Kubisaki invoked
the Summoning Jutsu</font>

222
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before the fall of the castle.</font>

223
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the thing he summoned...</font>

224
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:09,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was big enough to swallow
the entire castle whole.</font>

225
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the time we entered the castle,
we, too, have been gobbled up!</font>

226
00:15:13,970 --> 00:15:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why would this thing go to the trouble
of transforming to a castle to eat us?</font>

227
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.</font>

228
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?</font>

229
00:15:33,990 --> 00:15:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Help!</font>

230
00:15:36,410 --> 00:15:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you the lady of the Land of Honey?</font>

231
00:15:38,330 --> 00:15:40,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's embedded in the wall.</font>

232
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are from the Village Hidden
in the Leaves.</font>

233
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have come to help you.</font>

234
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, I'll help you out now.</font>

235
00:15:50,300 --> 00:15:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's no use.
— Please hang on!</font>

236
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no! This thing is rounding up
all the humans inside here</font>

237
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and returning to its original form.</font>

238
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, we're in danger, too!</font>

239
00:16:05,690 --> 00:16:08,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Hinata,
we've got to get out of here!</font>

240
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man Beast Clone!</font>

241
00:16:14,570 --> 00:16:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang over Fang!</font>

242
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the castle.</font>

243
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:29,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And by order of my master, Gosa,
I am to eat all who set foot within.</font>

244
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto!
— Ouch.</font>

245
00:16:48,230 --> 00:16:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll eat you.</font>

246
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can we get out of its stomach?!</font>

247
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.</font>

248
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:58,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this creature was summoned,</font>

249
00:16:58,990 --> 00:17:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then there should be a scroll
for the contract.</font>

250
00:17:00,910 --> 00:17:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we tear that up, then this creature
should return to the world it came from.</font>

251
00:17:04,370 --> 00:17:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

252
00:17:09,670 --> 00:17:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hinata!
— Right!</font>

253
00:17:11,050 --> 00:17:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

254
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Found it.</font>

255
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's up above,
probably in the castle tower.</font>

256
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How are we supposed
to get up there like this?!</font>

257
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The wall's Chakra have begun
to stabilize again.</font>

258
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that?</font>

259
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosa Kubisaki!</font>

260
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be fooled again.</font>

261
00:17:50,750 --> 00:17:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That, too, is just a phantom
created by the Summoning.</font>

262
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! He looks different
from the one before.</font>

263
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he doing?</font>

264
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He seems to want us to follow him.</font>

265
00:18:44,470 --> 00:18:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? He disappeared!</font>

266
00:18:47,850 --> 00:18:49,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, over there.</font>

267
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's the scroll!</font>

268
00:18:54,820 --> 00:18:56,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's starting to act up again.</font>

269
00:18:56,650 --> 00:18:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hurry, Naruto!
— Right!</font>

270
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

271
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the true form
of the summoned animal.</font>

272
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The concentration of acid is increasing.</font>

273
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, let's hurry and wind things up!</font>

274
00:19:17,050 --> 00:19:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute.</font>

275
00:19:18,590 --> 00:19:20,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if, when this summoned animal
goes back to where it came from,</font>

276
00:19:20,930 --> 00:19:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it takes us with it, too?</font>

277
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll just have to take our chances.
We gotta do this!</font>

278
00:19:27,470 --> 00:19:28,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

279
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did that do it?</font>

280
00:19:33,690 --> 00:19:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

281
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto!
— Naruto!</font>

282
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there, Naruto.</font>

283
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It should be possible
to tear the wall at that spot.</font>

284
00:19:46,330 --> 00:19:49,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

285
00:19:53,790 --> 00:19:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

286
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

287
00:20:25,910 --> 00:20:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lord of this castle must have died</font>

288
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">resenting the people
who seized the castle from him.</font>

289
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he also led us
to where the scroll was hidden.</font>

290
00:20:34,670 --> 00:20:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, does that mean that he decided
to let go of his grudge?</font>

291
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surely that must be the case.</font>

292
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's more, he must have felt sorry</font>

293
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the summoned animal
that served him nobly for 50 years</font>

294
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and wanted to release it.</font>

295
00:20:49,010 --> 00:20:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

296
00:20:50,970 --> 00:20:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then maybe he was waiting
for someone</font>

297
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:56,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to release the summoned animal
from its spell.</font>

298
00:20:58,270 --> 00:21:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now, it has finally returned
to its own world.</font>

299
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

300
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">on a checkerboard night</font></font></b></font></font>

301
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">ichimatsu no yoru ni</font></font></b></font></font>

302
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">when the stardust's are rapidly dancing</font></font></b></font></font>

303
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:40,120
